msgid "Object storage: region"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:114
msgid "Region of the bucket, for example eu-central-1; auto for Cloudflare R2. Empty (default) = us-east-1. When WPLC_S3_REGION is defined in wp-config.php, the constant wins and the field is read-only."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:117
msgid "Object storage: endpoint"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:118
msgid "HTTPS address of the storage service without a path, for example https://ACCOUNT-ID.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Empty (default) = Amazon S3 in the region above. When WPLC_S3_ENDPOINT is defined in wp-config.php, the constant wins and the field is read-only."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:121
msgid "Object storage: bucket in the path"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:122
msgid "On: the bucket is addressed in the path of the address (https://endpoint/bucket/…), which some providers such as MinIO need. Off (default): the bucket is a subdomain of the endpoint; bucket names with dots or capital letters always use the path. When WPLC_S3_PATH_STYLE is defined in wp-config.php, the constant wins and the field is read-only."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:126
msgid "Beta versions for licenses"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:127
msgid "On (default, as before): licenses may receive beta versions when the customer site asks for them; with client library 2.4.0 the customer turns them on in the add-on. Off: only stable versions, unless a plan allows beta under \"Rules of this plan\" in the product editor. A plan can also forbid beta while this is on. A client without the right gets the newest stable version; the signed answer lists the channels of the license (update_channels)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:130
msgid "Combine automatic renewals"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:134
msgid "Combined renewal: most licenses per order"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:135
msgid "Largest number of licenses charged together in one combined renewal order. Further due licenses of the same customer are renewed in the next combined order or on their own. Default: 20. Only used when automatic renewals are combined."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:138
msgid "Grace period after the paid period"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:139
msgid "Days after the end of the paid period during which a license with a pending or failed automatic charge keeps its access. Default: 14. Keep it longer than the last retry day below, or the last attempts fall after access has ended. A changed value applies to renewals scheduled afterwards; renewals already scheduled keep their date."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:142
msgid "Retry days of a failed charge"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:143
msgid "Days after the start of the new period on which a failed automatic charge is tried again, separated by commas. The number of entries is the number of retries. Default: 1,3,7. Empty = no retry: the first failed charge is final."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:146
msgid "Manual renewal: days before the end"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:147
msgid "From this many days before the end of the paid period a customer can renew by hand in the account, and the emails offer it. Default: 30. 0 = only from the day the period ends."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:150
msgid "Manual renewal: days after the end"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:151
msgid "Until this many days after the end of the paid period an expired license can still be renewed and continues with the same key and the same sites. Default: 30. 0 = an expired license cannot be reactivated by the customer."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:154
msgid "Open review case defers the expiry for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:155
msgid "Days, counted from the start of the case, during which a renewal that waits for your review (unknown payment result) keeps its license from expiring, because the customer may have paid. Access to updates still ends with the grace period. Afterwards the license expires normally; the case stays open and can still be booked. Default: 30."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:158
msgid "Reminder lead days"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:159
msgid "Days before the end of the paid period on which a reminder is sent, separated by commas. Default: 30,7."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:162
msgid "Renewal notice lead days"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:166
msgid "Price change notice period"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:170
msgid "Sender note"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:175
msgid "Largest quantity of one license product a customer can put into the cart and order. Every unit becomes a license of its own with its own key. Default: 100. 0 = no limit. An order you create yourself in the admin or through the REST API is not blocked; a larger quantity there is noted on the order and in the audit log. A plan can set its own largest quantity in the product editor. Large quantities are issued in background batches after payment (filter wplc_license_issue_batch_size)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:178
msgid "Suspended licenses count as ended after"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:182
msgid "Upgrade offer valid for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:183
msgid "Hours during which an unpaid upgrade order keeps its prorated price. The price falls every day; after this time the customer clicks \"Upgrade\" again for a new price. Default: 24."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:186
msgid "Show the license term at the price"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:187
msgid "On (default): the price of a license product shows its term, for example \"/ year\". Off: the price is shown as WooCommerce prints it."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:190
msgid "Renew licenses of products no longer sold"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:191
msgid "Off (default): a customer cannot renew a license by hand in the account while its product is not for sale (private, draft or not purchasable). On: such a license can still be renewed at the price of its plan. Automatic renewals are not affected."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:194
msgid "Deleting the saved card ends automatic renewal"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:195
msgid "On (default): when the customer deletes the saved payment method in the account, through a personal data erasure or by deleting the account, automatic renewal of the licenses paid with it is switched off. Off: automatic renewal stays on, and the next charge fails unless another component moves the licenses to a new payment method."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:198
msgid "Payment methods paid on delivery"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:199
msgid "IDs of WooCommerce payment methods, one per line, whose orders count as paid only when they are completed, because the order is \"processing\" before the money arrived. Licenses, manual renewals and plan upgrades paid with them start when you complete the order. Default: cod (cash on delivery)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:203
msgid "Cancelled or failed order suspends its licenses"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:204
msgid "On (default): when a paid order is cancelled or fails afterwards (for example a bounced direct debit), the licenses it issued or renewed are suspended until you reactivate them. Off: the licenses stay as they are; check the order yourself. A full refund always revokes the licenses, whatever is set here."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:207
msgid "Removed order line suspends its licenses"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:208
msgid "On (default): when a line of a paid order is removed or its quantity lowered after the licenses were issued, the licenses above the new quantity are suspended until you reactivate them. Off: they stay as they are."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:211
msgid "Partial refund by amount: review notice"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:212
msgid "On (default): a refund of part of the amount without refunding whole licenses changes no license, but asks you to review it: it is written to the order notes and the audit log of each license of the order, and the health alert \"license needs review\" is sent to the alert recipients. Off: no notice, as before (a renewal or upgrade order still gets its own order note). Refunding licenses by quantity revokes them in both cases."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:215
msgid "Won payment dispute reactivates the license"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:216
msgid "Off (default): a license suspended because of a payment dispute stays suspended when the dispute is decided for the shop, until you reactivate it. On: it is reactivated automatically (only when it is still suspended because of that dispute and its paid period has not ended)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:219
msgid "Customers can upgrade their plan"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:220
msgid "On (default): the customer account offers a more expensive plan of the same product; the customer pays the price difference for the rest of the paid period, prorated by day. Off: the offer is not shown and a request is refused. Administrators can always change the plan. An upgrade order the customer started before stays payable while its offer is valid."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:223
msgid "Customers can switch to a cheaper plan"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:224
msgid "On (default): the customer account offers a cheaper plan of the same product, which starts with the next renewal (no credit for the current period). Off: the offer is not shown and a request is refused; a switch already scheduled stays. Administrators can always change the plan."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:227
msgid "License key prefix"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:228
msgid "The first four characters of every license key and license reference, for example ACME for ACME-1A2B3C4D. A letter followed by three letters or digits. Default: WPLC. Can only be changed before the first license is issued, because every key contains it; the length of the keys stays the same."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:231
msgid "Offline period of customer sites"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:232
msgid "Days a customer site may rely on the last signed answer of this server when it cannot reach it. Default: 14. The period never reaches beyond the end of access of the license: a license whose paid period or grace period ends earlier stops working offline at that end. A plan can set its own period in the product editor."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:235
msgid "New sites per license and hour"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:236
msgid "How many new installations one license may activate within an hour, at least twice its live-site limit, so that an agency can still set up all its sites. Activating a known installation again does not count. Default: 10. 0 = no limit."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:240
msgid "How many staging copies each live site of a license may activate free of charge. A staging site must be plausible for a copy of its live site (same domain, a local address or a hosting provider domain below); otherwise it counts as a live site. Default: 1. 0 = staging sites are not included. A plan can set its own number in the product editor."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:243
msgid "Development sites per license"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:244
msgid "How many development installations on local addresses a license may activate at the same time without using a live slot: at least this number and at least twice the live-site limit of the license. Default: 5. 0 = development sites are not included. A plan can set its own exact number in the product editor."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:247
msgid "Staging: name parts"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: list of the built-in name parts.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:250
#, php-format
msgid "Parts of an address left of the domain that mark a copy of a site, one per line (for example staging for staging.shop.example). A live site cannot move to such an address with its activation; the copy activates as a staging site of its own. Only the part left of the domain counts: a top-level domain such as .dev never makes a site a staging copy. Default: %s."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:255
msgid "Staging: hosting provider domains"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: list of the built-in domains.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:258
#, php-format
msgid "Domains of hosting providers whose subdomains are temporary or staging addresses, one per line, without the leading dot (for example kinsta.cloud for mysite.kinsta.cloud). A subdomain of these domains is accepted as the staging copy of any live site. At least two parts (example.com); a single top-level domain is not accepted. Default: %s."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:263
msgid "Local addresses: endings"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: list of the built-in endings.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:266
#, php-format
msgid "Endings of addresses that only exist on a local computer or network, one per line, without the leading dot (for example test for shop.test). Development sites are only accepted on such addresses, on names without a dot and on private IP addresses; they also count as staging copies. Do not add an ending of the public internet (such as com): every site under it could then activate as a development site without using a live slot. Default: %s."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:272
msgid "How many co-users the owner of a license can invite in the customer account (accepted co-users plus open invitations). Co-users see the license with its key, sites and downloads in their own account. Default: 5. 0 = co-users are switched off: nobody can be invited and open invitations can no longer be accepted; co-users who accepted before keep their access until the owner removes them. A plan can set its own number in the product editor."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:275
msgid "Invitations valid for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:276
msgid "Days during which the link of an invitation (co-user or transfer) can be accepted. Default: 14. A changed value applies to invitations sent afterwards."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:279
msgid "Customers can transfer licenses"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:280
msgid "On (default): the owner can hand a license over to another customer from the account; the recipient accepts with the link in an email. Off: the transfer form is hidden and open transfers can no longer be accepted; you can still change the owner in the admin."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:283
msgid "New license key on transfer"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:284
msgid "Off (default): the license keeps its key and the activated sites keep working after a transfer accepted in the account. On: the transfer also issues a new key, so the previous owner can no longer use the old one; the new owner enters the new key on the sites."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:287
msgid "Address of the license page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:288
msgid "Last part of the address of the license page in the customer account, for example licenses or lizenzen: lowercase letters, digits and hyphens. Default: wplc-licenses. The new address works at once; links in emails sent before lead to the old address and find no page. It must differ from the site page and from the other pages of the account."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:291
msgid "Menu item of the license page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:292
msgid "Name of the license page in the menu of the customer account and its heading. Empty (default) = \"Licenses\" in the language of the customer. Your own name is shown as it is in every language."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:295
msgid "Licenses per page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:296
msgid "How many licenses the license page of the customer account shows at a time; further licenses are on the next pages. Default: 10."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:299
msgid "Address of the site page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:300
msgid "Last part of the address of the page \"Sites\" in the customer account, for example sites or websites: lowercase letters, digits and hyphens. Default: wplc-sites. It must differ from the license page and from the other pages of the account."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:303
msgid "Menu item of the site page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:304
msgid "Name of the page \"Sites\" in the menu of the customer account. Empty (default) = \"Sites\" in the language of the customer. Your own name is shown as it is in every language."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:307
msgid "Sites per page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:308
msgid "How many sites the page \"Sites\" of the customer account shows at a time. Default: 25."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:311
msgid "Site counts as not seen after"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:312
msgid "Days without contact after which the page \"Sites\" marks a site with \"No contact for more than … days\". Default: 14."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:315
msgid "License counts as ending soon"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:316
msgid "Days before the end of the paid period from which the page \"Sites\" marks a license that does not renew automatically as ending soon. Default: 30."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:319
msgid "Consent to the immediate start (right of withdrawal)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:320
msgid "Whether the checkout asks the customer to agree that the license is provided before the withdrawal period ends. \"Automatic\" (default) asks unless Germanized or German Market is active, because these plugins ask themselves."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:323
msgid "The consent is required to buy"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:324
msgid "On (default): a license can only be bought with the consent. Off: the box is optional and only recorded when ticked; the customer then keeps the right of withdrawal."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:327
msgid "Wording of the withdrawal consent"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:328
msgid "Text next to the checkbox. Empty (default) = the built-in wording in the language of the customer. Your own wording is shown as it is in every language. The text the customer saw is stored with the order as proof."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:331
msgid "Cancellation page: requests per hour"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:332
msgid "How many cancellation requests the public cancellation page (shortcode [wplc_cancel]) accepts per hour, counted per visitor address, per license reference and, for order numbers, per email address. Default: 5. The page itself is shown where you place the shortcode. Whether it meets a legal requirement for a cancellation button in your country is for you to check."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:335
msgid "Wording of the consent to automatic renewal"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:336
msgid "Text next to the checkbox for automatic renewal, in the classic and in the block checkout. Empty (default) = the built-in wording in the language of the customer. Your own wording is shown as it is in every language. The text the customer saw is stored as proof of the consent."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:339
msgid "Keep the audit log for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:340
msgid "Days after which entries of the audit log are deleted. Default: 730. 0 = never delete."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:343
msgid "Keep processed payment events for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:344
msgid "Days after which payment events that were processed completely are deleted. Default: 180. 0 = never delete."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:347
msgid "Keep unresolved payment events for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:348
msgid "Days after which payment events that still need work are deleted. Default: 730. 0 = never delete."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:351
msgid "Keep deactivated sites of ended licenses for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:352
msgid "Days after which deactivated installations of ended licenses are deleted. Default: 365. 0 = never delete."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:355
msgid "Keep deactivated sites of running licenses for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:356
msgid "Days after which deactivated installations of running licenses are deleted. Default: 365. 0 = never delete."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:359
msgid "Switch off sites of an ended license after"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:360
msgid "Days after the paid period of an expired license at which its still active installations are deactivated. Default: 30. 0 = never."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:363
msgid "Keep the email log for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:364
msgid "Days after which entries of the notification log are deleted. Default: 730. 0 = never delete."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:367
msgid "Detach ended licenses from the customer after"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:368
msgid "Days after the end of a license at which the owner, the payment token reference and the installations are removed. Counted from the end of the calendar year in which the license ended. Default: 3650 (ten years, the technical default so far). 0 = never."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:371
msgid "Keep proof of renewal consent for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:372
msgid "Days after which the proof of a consent to automatic renewal is deleted, once its license has ended. Counted from the end of the calendar year of the consent. Default: 3650 (ten years, the technical default so far). 0 = never delete."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:375
msgid "Keep the webhook delivery log for"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:376
msgid "Days after which entries of the delivery log of the outgoing webhooks (event, body with record IDs, status code, error) are deleted. Default: 30. 0 = never delete by age; in any case at most the newest 100 entries per endpoint are kept."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:379
msgid "Support email address"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:380
msgid "Address that license emails, the customer account and the cancellation page name for questions. Empty (default) = the sender address of the WooCommerce emails, else the address of the site administrator."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:383
#: templates/wplc-cancel.php:61
msgid "Support page"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:384
msgid "Optional address of your support or contact page (https://…). The customer account and the cancellation page link to it next to the support address. Empty (default) = no link."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:387
msgid "Send health alerts to"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:388
msgid "Email addresses, separated by commas, that get a message when a figure of the diagnostics page reaches its alert threshold (for example failed background jobs or rejected webhooks). At most one collected email per day. Empty (default) = no email; the alerts are then only available to code (action wplc/health_alert)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:392
msgid "Remind to rotate keys after"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:393
msgid "Months after which the license key secret, the installation secret encryption key and the response signing key should be replaced. A key that is older is shown on the diagnostics page, raises the health figure \"Keys due for rotation\" and a notice for administrators. Default: 0 = no reminder. The age counts from the day this server first saw the key (keys carry no date of their own; for keys that existed before, from the first day after the update that added this setting). Replacing a key stays a task for wp-config.php and WP-CLI."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:396
msgid "Verbose log"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:397
msgid "Writes additional lines of the level debug to the WooCommerce log (source wp-license) to trace a problem. It switches itself off after the chosen time. Off (default). The constant WPLC_DEBUG in wp-config.php switches it on permanently."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:400
msgid "When the plugin is deleted"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:401
msgid "Keep (default): licenses, activations, renewals, the audit log and the settings stay in the database when the plugin is deleted, because they are business records. Delete: the tables and options of the plugin are removed for good when it is deleted; uploaded packages and order data are never removed. The constant WPLC_REMOVE_ALL_DATA in wp-config.php also deletes. Deleting cannot be undone; make a backup first."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:422
msgid "Failed background jobs (24 hours)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:423
msgid "Problems with update packages"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:425
msgid "Keys due for rotation"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: name of a figure of the diagnostics page.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:439
#, php-format
msgid "Alert from: %s"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: default threshold.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:442
#, php-format
msgid "A health alert is raised when this figure of the diagnostics page reaches this number: the action wplc/health_alert fires and, with recipients above, the collected email is sent. Default: %s. 0 = never alert for this figure."
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:465
msgid "Automatic: ask, unless Germanized or German Market is active"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:466
msgid "Always ask"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:467
msgid "Never ask"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:471
msgid "On for 24 hours"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:472
msgid "On for 7 days"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:475
msgid "Keep all data"
msgstr ""

#: src/Settings/Texts.php:476
msgid "Delete tables and options"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: name of a setting.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:498
#, php-format
msgid "\"%s\" was not changed: enter a whole number."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: name of a setting, 2: smallest value, 3: largest value.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:501
#, php-format
msgid "\"%1$s\" was not changed: enter whole numbers from %2$s to %3$s."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: name of a setting, 2: largest number of entries.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:504
#, php-format
msgid "\"%1$s\" was not changed: at most %2$s entries are possible."
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: name of a setting, 2: largest number of characters.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:507
#, php-format
msgid "\"%1$s\" was not changed: the text is longer than %2$s characters."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: name of a setting.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:510
#, php-format
msgid "\"%s\" was not changed: enter valid email addresses."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: name of a setting.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:513
#, php-format
msgid "\"%s\" was not changed: enter an address that starts with https://."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: name of a setting.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:516
#, php-format
msgid "\"%s\" was not changed: enter four characters, a letter followed by letters or digits, for example ACME."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: name of a setting.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:519
#, php-format
msgid "\"%s\" was not changed: licenses were already issued with the current value, and their keys would stop working."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: name of a setting.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:523
#, php-format
msgid "\"%s\" was not changed: at least one entry is not valid. Enter one entry per line, lowercase letters, digits, dots and hyphens only."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: name of a setting.
#: src/Settings/Texts.php:527
#, php-format
msgid "\"%s\" was not changed: the value is not valid."
msgstr ""

#: src/Update/CustomerDownload.php:122
msgid "No download is available for this product yet. You will find it here as soon as a version has been released."
msgstr ""

#: src/Update/CustomerDownload.php:123
msgid "No version was released while this license was paid, so there is nothing to download."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: release version number.
#: src/Update/CustomerDownload.php:142
#, php-format
msgid "%s (latest)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Update/CustomerDownload.php:147
msgid "Download"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: release version number.
#: src/Update/CustomerDownload.php:152
#, php-format
msgid "Download version %s"
msgstr ""

#: src/Update/CustomerDownload.php:156
msgid "This license has ended. You can still download the versions that were released while it was paid; newer versions need a renewal."
msgstr ""

#: src/Update/CustomerDownload.php:220
msgid "Invalid request."
msgstr ""

#: src/Update/CustomerDownload.php:225
msgid "This download link has expired. Please reload the page and try again."
